# What a source distribution must not carry.
#
# The wheel and the single-file builds are safe by construction: pyproject.toml
# names the packages one by one with include-package-data off, and
# tools/build_pyz.py stages only the package and the curated examples. The
# sdist is the loose end, being built from the checkout, so the two directories
# that exist only for whoever clones the repository are pruned by hand.
prune benchmark
prune assets
global-exclude .DS_Store *.pyc
